<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 20/23.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 20/23.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania  set on</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Monday, June 23 on Friday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   23.06.97	  20.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5812	    6.5540</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3188	    2.3086</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5358	    4.5138</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4910	    3.5276</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5182	    0.5160</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7745	    0.7713</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2899	    0.2886</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0108	    7.0108</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6943	    0.6944</p>
<p>    PLN	  7.0108	    1.2322</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
